msgctxt "Addon:11648:0:0"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Extraction failed.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Не удалось извлечь.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>マギアボードにストックされたロゴスアクションがいっぱいです。新たに抽出した記憶を使用可能にするには、ストック中のロゴスアクションと入れ替えてください。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Maximale Anzahl an Logos-Kommandos erreicht. Du kannst das alte Kommando überschreiben oder das Neue verwerfen.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Votre réserve d'actions Logos est pleine. Supprimez un set si vous désirez obtenir celui-ci.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:11649:0:0"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Your magia board cannot accommodate any more logos actions. To use a newly extracted mneme, you must first replace an existing action.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>На плате магии больше нет места для действий логоса. Чтобы использовать новую мнему, сначала замените уже установленное действие.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>前回抽出した記憶が残ったままです。マギアボードに空きがあるため、このままストックします。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Die extrahierte Erinnerung wurde auf der Magi-Tafel abgelegt.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Un set d'une ou plusieurs actions Logos datant de votre dernière extraction est encore dans le mélangeur. Il va être ajouté à votre réserve d'actions Logos.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:11650:0:0"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>A recently extracted mneme remains and has been allocated to your magia board.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Недавно извлечённая мнема осталась и была добавлена на плату магии.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>前回抽出した記憶が残ったままです。ストック中のロゴスアクションと入れ替えるか、破棄してください。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Willst du die extrahierte Erinnerung behalten oder verwerfen?</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Un set d'une ou plusieurs actions Logos datant de votre dernière extraction est encore dans le mélangeur. Remplacez un de votre réserve ou jetez-le.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:11651:0:0"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>A recently extracted mneme remains. You must destroy the mneme or replace an existing logos action to continue.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Недавно извлечённая мнема ещё не использована. Уничтожьте её или замените ею одно из действий логоса, чтобы продолжить.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

